---
name: Own files only
description: In a run with parallel agents, write only the file your agent instructions name and never edit another agent's file.
---

Several agents may run at the same time in the same folder. Each agent owns the files its own instructions tell it to write, and nothing else.

Write only the files your instructions name. You may read other files when your instructions say so. Never create, edit, rename, or delete a file that another agent writes, even to fix it. If you think another agent's file is wrong, say so in your reply instead.
